---

GridShell bundles a small number of third-party tools and fonts as separate,
unmodified files under GridShell.Grid/Tools and the various Fonts folders.
Each keeps its own license (see the accompanying *.LICENSE.* / *.COPYING.*
file next to it):

  - chdman.exe            MAME project license (BSD-3-Clause / GPL-2.0 mix)
  - extract-xiso.exe      see Tools/extract-xiso.LICENSE.TXT
  - aria2c.exe             GPL-2.0, see Tools/aria2c.COPYING.txt
  - Roboto, Exo 2, Rajdhani, Orbitron fonts   SIL Open Font License 1.1
  - Material Symbols Outlined font            Apache License 2.0

These are distributed as separate executables/assets invoked at runtime, not
linked into or derived from GridShell's own code.
